en:
{0E}"So that you bring no shame on the name of Teridon,
I shall erase you without a trace.{0F}
Perish!"{w}

"Oh, it's you guys!
A huge army of monsters attacked the city!
...Huh? You already know?"{w}{p}"Things were pretty crazy over here too, but... I wonder why the monsters suddenly pulled out of the city?"{w}

"What the hell... what am I supposed to do!?
Is it the beard? Is that beard the problem?
If I lace that beard with poison, will you die!?"{w}

"Eeeek! Scary! Scary! So freakin' scaryyy!
Don't chase me while you're spurting a nosebleed!
Hey, what the hell is this!? Some kind of horror show!?!"{w}

{0E}"...? My name? Like I said, it's Decoyki...?
Oh, I'm so sorry! I was so wrapped up in Decoykins!{0F}
I'm Milonya!"{w}
